# The assessment of AGT-002 against this build. The requirement identifier is this
# file's stem and appears nowhere inside it, because a second place to spell the identity
# is a second place for it to be wrong -- the rule OD-SPEC-007 chose for a record
# registration, and CHK-003.assessment states for this registry.
#
# AGT-002: "Agents shall return structured plans, changes, claims, tests, requested
# verification, assumptions, and unresolved questions." Seven named return-shape elements.
#
# Five of the seven have real, independently-built typed analogs, scattered across separate
# crates rather than unified in one agent-response type: plans and changes are
# `CorrectionPlan`/`ChangeSet` in `nomos-corrections`; a claim's evidentiary strength is
# `Finding`/`EvidenceClass` in `nomos-contracts`; tests and requested verification are
# `VerificationPredicate` (`nomos-scope-verification`, reused by `nomos-ledger`) and
# `VerificationRecord` (`nomos-ledger`), real and tested (a claimed item's own predicate,
# actually run to completion, not an agent's word).
#
# 'Assumptions' and 'unresolved questions' have zero real grounding -- a workspace-wide
# search finds neither concept in any real type. `CorrectionCandidate` already carries a
# proposed change's free-text `description` and carries neither; `LedgerItem` already
# carries free-text `why`/`done_when` and carries neither either. Nothing anywhere returns
# all seven elements together as one structured response.
verdict: Partial
site: crates/corrections/nomos-corrections/src/correction_plan.rs#CorrectionPlan
site: crates/corrections/nomos-corrections/src/change_set.rs#ChangeSet
site: crates/contracts/nomos-contracts/src/reporting/finding.rs#Finding
site: crates/contracts/nomos-contracts/src/reporting/finding/evidence_class.rs#EvidenceClass
site: crates/substrate/nomos-scope-verification/src/verification_predicate.rs#VerificationPredicate
site: crates/substrate/nomos-ledger/src/verification.rs#VerificationRecord
gap: crates/corrections/nomos-corrections/src/correction_id/correction_candidate.rs#CorrectionCandidate
gap: crates/substrate/nomos-ledger/src/item/ledger_item.rs#LedgerItem
